# status: 1
# output_has:
#   - "W-IFC-1"
# provenance: property: T55 through W-TRI-1 (enforced by W-IFC-1), bounded exhaustive over labels {pii}, {untrusted}, {pii, untrusted} and sink in {emit, public store} (this test {pii}, emit): the oracle says a value carrying the confidentiality label pii reaching a public sink requires change, and the integrity label untrusted alone does not restrict it.
